### Register
POST http://localhost:3002/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:3002/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Me (replace TOKEN)
GET http://localhost:3002/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Products
GET http://localhost:3002/products?page=1&size=12&sort=latest

### Add to cart
POST http://localhost:3002/cart
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

### Checkout
POST http://localhost:3002/orders/checkout
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payment_method": "cod",
  "address": {
    "line1": "123 Main St",
    "city": "Metropolis",
    "state": "CA",
    "postal_code": "94000",
    "country": "USA"
  }
}
